          <row><entry align="left"><para>onvifAvgPowerConsumption</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>Average power consumption (in watts) (Device exposes this value directly (e.g. AXIS 9.8W); RFC 3621 has no average power object.)</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>1.3.6.1.4.1.66630.1.1.1.2.1</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>ONVIF-MIB</para></entry></row>
